   1658  fa26							; ClearPFColumn — A = left-half col 0..19; LineCount ($84) = first row;
   1659  fa26							;   CollisionEndY = last row (inclusive). AND-clear that col's
   1660  fa26							;   PF bit in those rows only. Clobbers A/X/Y + CPCScratch ($89) — NO
   1661  fa26							;   CollisionX (plan 5.1: BombMarkWalls keeps its broken-wall count there
   1662  fa26							;   across the call). Same-bank rts tail: BombMarkWalls jsrs this directly;
