   2389  fe03							; --- does the player count as "over the raft"? --------------------------
   2390  fe03							; The raft is a FERRY (user rule 2026-10-18): it moves ONLY while he is over
   2391  fe03							; it, parks the moment he steps off, and its position resets on room entry
   2392  fe03							; (LoadEnemyRam re-copies the record's spawn x). Gating the whole motion
   2393  fe03							; block here is what makes it park; the pin/carry later still applies while
   2394  fe03							; riding. The test runs against the CURRENT x (before the step), i.e. the
   2395  fe03							; raft he is actually standing on.
   2396  fe03		       a5 80		      lda	RoomX
   2397  fe05		       38		      sec
   2398  fe06		       f5 bd		      sbc	EnemyRamX,X
   2399  fe08		       18		      clc
